@startuml
' Analytical UML class view of the existing candidate R24-01..15, 4 November 2026.
' NOT an adopted class hierarchy, complete ontology, or standards normative profile.
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide empty methods
package "Evidence and referents" {
  class SourceAssertion <<source evidence>> {
    issuer
    edition
    originalLocator
    evidenceStanding
    timePrecision
  }
  class DescribedSubject <<source focal referent>> {
    standing : REFERENCE | INDIVIDUAL | CONTINUING_STATION
    sourceIdentity
  }
  class ProductKind <<design / model>>
  class DigitalRepresentation <<digital resource / proxy>>
  class DerivedOrCopiedRecord <<derived / copy>>
}
package "Equipment, context and function" {
  class EquipmentParticipant <<physical or software>>
  class HostOrStation <<host / manager>>
  class FunctionalRole <<sensing / processing / reporting>>
  class NativeInterface <<port / bus / address>>
  class OutputField <<field / quantity>>
}
package "State and actual activity" {
  class SettingOrStatus <<default / applied / reported>>
  class DeclaredCapability <<possible method / action>>
  class PerformedObservation <<original performed act>>
  class CommandEvidence <<actual correlated chain>>
  class ServiceAtHost <<dated equipment role>>
  class MaintenanceOrUpdate <<historical event>>
  class SupportQualifier <<power / comm / security / QA>>
}
SourceAssertion --> DescribedSubject : R24-01 asserts-about
ProductKind ..> EquipmentParticipant : R24-02 qualified design / kind
DigitalRepresentation ..> DescribedSubject : R24-02 represents
EquipmentParticipant ..> DescribedSubject : R24-03 physical constituent-of (if evidenced)
EquipmentParticipant .. DescribedSubject : R24-04 externally connected (not same as part-of)
EquipmentParticipant ..> HostOrStation : R24-05 hosted / assigned / managed-by
EquipmentParticipant ..> FunctionalRole : R24-06 realizes function
FunctionalRole ..> DeclaredCapability : R24-06 declares capability
EquipmentParticipant ..> NativeInterface : R24-07 uses native interface
FunctionalRole ..> OutputField : R24-08 emits output
NativeInterface ..> OutputField : R24-08 carries output
OutputField ..> PerformedObservation : R24-09 only with real observing act
EquipmentParticipant ..> SettingOrStatus : R24-10 default != effective != reported
DeclaredCapability ..> CommandEvidence : R24-11 only for recorded request/ACK/effect
EquipmentParticipant ..> ServiceAtHost : R24-12 subject to original date precision
ServiceAtHost ..> HostOrStation : R24-12 role at Host
MaintenanceOrUpdate ..> EquipmentParticipant : R24-13 event concerns
SupportQualifier ..> EquipmentParticipant : R24-14 source-qualified support
DerivedOrCopiedRecord ..> SourceAssertion : R24-15 derived from ORIGINAL evidence
note right of DescribedSubject
  No universal manufactured chassis,
  compulsory UML cardinalities, or
  single adopted superclass established.
end note
note bottom of PerformedObservation
  Manufacturer examples are not actual events.
  Do not fabricate original resultTime or
  the mean-producing System for Bennett.
end note
@enduml
